{"id":"cc32a2c3b871a820","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-formal-complexity-measure.md","title":"布尔公式的形式复杂度测度","display":"df-formal-complexity-measure — 布尔公式的形式复杂度测度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-formal-complexity-measure","aliases":["28-df-formal-complexity-measure"],"display":"df-formal-complexity-measure — 布尔公式的形式复杂度测度","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§23.2.3","source_printed_pages":"502","source_pdf_pages":"528","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-formal-complexity-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-formal-complexity-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formal-complexity-measure — 布尔公式的形式复杂度测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§23.2.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"502"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"528"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(f,g\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i(x)=x_i\">\\(p_i(x)=x_i\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar f(x)=1-f(x)\">\\(\\bar f(x)=1-f(x)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f\\land g)(x)=f(x)g(x)\">\\((f\\land g)(x)=f(x)g(x)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f\\lor g)(x)=1-(1-f(x))(1-g(x))\">\\((f\\lor g)(x)=1-(1-f(x))(1-g(x))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mu(p_i)\\le1\\land\\mu(\\bar p_i)\\le1)\\;\\land\\;\\forall f,g\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;(\\mu(f\\land g)\\le\\mu(f)+\\mu(g)\\land\\mu(f\\lor g)\\le\\mu(f)+\\mu(g))\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mu(p_i)\\le1\\land\\mu(\\bar p_i)\\le1)\\;\\land\\;\\forall f,g\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;(\\mu(f\\land g)\\le\\mu(f)+\\mu(g)\\land\\mu(f\\lor g)\\le\\mu(f)+\\mu(g))\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书值域取非负整数，本条明确推广为非负实数；后续次可加性论证不使用整数性。只要求对文字的基值和两个二元连接词次可加，不偷偷加入 μ(¬f)=μ(f) 或单调性。这样保留自然证明障碍真正需要的最小条件。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§23.2.3；印刷页 502；PDF 页 528。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"p_i(x)=x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar f(x)=1-f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"(f\\land g)(x)=f(x)g(x)","display":false},{"tex":"(f\\lor g)(x)=1-(1-f(x))(1-g(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(\\mu(p_i)\\le1\\land\\mu(\\bar p_i)\\le1)\\;\\land\\;\\forall f,g\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;(\\mu(f\\land g)\\le\\mu(f)+\\mu(g)\\land\\mu(f\\lor g)\\le\\mu(f)+\\mu(g))\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1534,"backlinks":[{"id":"21fb1aba77483012","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，假定 $\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)$，其定义见 [[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]。$f\\in\\mathcal B_n$，$S\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$\\mu(f)\\ge S$。$g$ 在全部 $2^{2^n}$ 个布尔函数中均匀抽样；$h=f\\oplus g$，XOR 逐点取模二和。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-410","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound]]、[[28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere]]、[[28-df-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]、[[28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound]]、[[28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness]]、[[28-ex-singleton-property-not-large]]。"},{"id":"5334a7b3a430e884","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)$ 见 [[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]；$\\log_2$ 为二底对数，$S>0$，$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$。函数 g 在 $\\mathcal B_n$ 上均匀。"},{"id":"7e655292323dacd0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，假定 $\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)$，其定义见 [[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]。$\\operatorname{FS}(f)$ 采用 [[28-df-formula-size]]；FS 计所有语法树节点。"}],"outgoing":[]}